Task: 22
Title: Integration tests (E2E pipeline, resume, quick-fix, backward loop, error handling)
Phase: 4
Route: full
Slice: Slice 4b — Integration
Dependencies: 08, 13, 20, 21
Scope: Create comprehensive integration test suite at `test/integration.test.ts`. Tests cover: full 10-stage pipeline E2E (orchestrator skill dispatches stage orchestrators in sequence, all prescribed artifacts appear in `.pipeline/qrspi-<run-id>/`), `/deepwork-resume` recovery from each stage boundary, quick-fix route completion in fewer stages, backward loop detection and replan artifact generation, error handling scenarios (subagent failure, missing state, git unavailable), and abort/recovery cycle. Tests use mocked Agent tool responses and file system fixtures to validate orchestrator decision logic without requiring live model calls.
Acceptance Criteria: AC 1 (full pipeline E2E), AC 2 (resume from state), AC 3 (quick-fix route), AC 4 (backward loop), AC 5 (error handling and abort), AC 6 (all 10 stage artifacts)
NFRs: NFR: Reliability (state recovery tests), NFR: Performance (sequential orchestration test)
Gate Criteria: Phase 4 replan gate (Integration tests pass)
Files:
  - test/integration.test.ts (CREATE) — E2E pipeline test: orchestrate all 10 stages with mocked Agent tool responses, validate artifact tree. Resume test: read state.md fixtures, verify next stage detection. Quick-fix test: verify route detection and stage skipping. Backward loop test: mock acceptance failure, verify detector triggers replan. Error tests: subagent failure, missing state, git unavailable, abort mid-pipeline.
